{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liquor Store Simulator</strong> is a simulation game about developing your own store. You start your business in a small shop that you bought on credit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it won\u2019t be easy\u2014you\u2019ll have to work at the checkout yourself, accept deliveries, keep records, and maintain order in the sales area. But hard work and smart decisions will help you turn a modest retail outlet into a thriving store with a wide selection and satisfied customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase goods, arrange retail equipment as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/55b1e130389f1057d61c74d4bf21d717.poster.avif?t=1770879223\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/55b1e130389f1057d61c74d4bf21d717.webm?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/55b1e130389f1057d61c74d4bf21d717.mp4?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Draft Beer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a bartender. Pour customers the beer they desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.poster.avif?t=1770879223\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.webm?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.mp4?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you\u2019ll have to do everything yourself. But as your store grows, you won\u2019t be able to handle it alone. Hire employees for efficient store management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.poster.avif?t=1770879223\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.webm?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.mp4?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the color of walls, ceilings, and floors. Make your store unique and unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/4b679d47db83e2236f84c5725a7e2268.poster.avif?t=1770879223\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/4b679d47db83e2236f84c5725a7e2268.webm?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/4b679d47db83e2236f84c5725a7e2268.mp4?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","ach