e=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/55b1e130389f1057d61c74d4bf21d717.mp4?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Draft Beer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a bartender. Pour customers the beer they desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.poster.avif?t=1770879223\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.webm?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/5a2390a76eaf0efd606215416cb77014.mp4?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you\u2019ll have to do everything yourself. But as your store grows, you won\u2019t be able to handle it alone. Hire employees for efficient store management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.poster.avif?t=1770879223\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.webm?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124550/extras/491a14129193751637ed384230481fb9.mp4?t=1770879223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr